<title>USA: Soybean sales to China 55,000 MT w/e July 24-USDA.</title>
<headline>Soybean sales to China 55,000 MT w/e July 24-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Department said Thursday U.S. soybean sales to China totaled 55,000 tonnes in the week ended July 24.</p>
<p>In its weekly export sales report, USDA said the soybeans are for delivery during the 1996/97 marketing year.</p>
</text>
